                <pb facs="0770" n="760" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg760"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.932/7–2048: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-07-20T19:00:00-04:00">July 20, 1948—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1053. Embtel 1320, July 20, Emb requested urge Chinese Govt seek immediately
                    legislative approval Senate reservation FCN treaty. Dept exploring possible
                    means for obtaining, either before or after exchange ratifications, objectives
                    sought in proposed exchanges notes. Views Emb requested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
